r every year and the climbing gets bigger. Both are true."},{"day":80,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. You're $27 in the hole."},{"day":80,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":80,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":80,"min":818,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":80,"min":818,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":80,"min":838,"text":"A wristband, and a look that says the comp wall is not for warming up on."},{"day":80,"min":846,"text":"Repeat: Double Clutch, V7, on go 2."},{"day":80,"min":854,"text":"Onsight: Balance Beam, V9, on go 1."},{"day":80,"min":862,"text":"Onsight: Volume Slab, V10, on go 1."},{"day":80,"min":862,"text":"The Quiet Art, done. $24 off the board."},{"day":80,"min":870,"text":"Onsight: Bat Hang, V12, on go 1."},{"day":80,"min":878,"text":"Sliding off, your hand drags over a seam. New beta: crimp the seam."},{"day":80,"min":896,"text":"Redpoint: The Pinch Slab, V11, on go 2."},{"day":80,"min":896,"text":"Gas, $2."},{"day":80,"min":938,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":80,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":80,"min":1080,"text":"You drive Hazel into town and back."},{"day":80,"min":1150,"text":"Hazel hums something tuneless and lets the silence do the rest."},{"day":81,"min":440,"text":"Hazel’s driveway. A real bathroom, and coffee in a real mug in the morning."},{"day":81,"min":440,"text":"The heater coughs out the last of the propane. The gear shop has more."},{"day":81,"min":460,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":81,"min":460,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":81,"min":493,"text":"The tank rides home on the passenger seat, belted in."},{"day":81,"min":857,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":81,"min":857,"text":"Gas, $8."},{"day":81,"min":912,"text":"A stamp on your hand, and a nod at the steep end."},{"day":81,"min":920,"text":"Onsight: Fingertip Cavern, V6, on go 1."},{"day":81,"min":928,"text":"Onsight: The Low Roof, V5, on go 1."},{"day":81,"min":936,"text":"Onsight: Ceiling Crawl, V7, on go 1."},{"day":81,"min":944,"text":"Onsight: Lip Service, V7, on go 1."},{"day":81,"min":944,"text":"Gas, $9."},{"day":81,"min":1021,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":81,"min":1091,"text":"Hazel pokes the fire and says it’s the best thing she’s done all day. It might be."},{"day":82,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":82,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":82,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":82,"min":818,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":82,"min":818,"text":"Gas, $8."},{"day":82,"min":843,"text":"A bang, then the steering pulls hard right. The rear tire is in strips on the shoulder, and the spare is flat too. Of course it is."},{"day":82,"min":963,"text":"Hazel drives out with a jack and a thermos, and doesn't mention it again. Not much, anyway."},{"day":82,"min":993,"text":"A stamp on your hand, and a nod at the steep end."},{"day":82,"min":1001,"text":"Repeat: The Low Roof, V5, on go 2."},{"day":82,"min":1009,"text":"Onsight: Stalactite, V8, on go 1."},{"day":82,"min":1017,"text":"Onsight: Undercut Engine, V9, on go 1."},{"day":82,"min":1025,"text":"Onsight: Dark Edges, V10, on go 1."},{"day":82,"min":1025,"text":"Gas, $9."},{"day":82,"min":1102,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":82,"min":1172,"text":"Hazel says she has a theory about chalk brands. She does not have a theory about chalk brands."},{"day":82,"min":1172,"text":"Ten minutes, one dead battery, one running engine, and a handshake that goes on slightly too long. They ask your name twice so they remember it."},{"day":83,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":83,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":83,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":83,"min":818,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":83,"min":818,"text":"Gas, $8."},{"day":83,"min":873,"text":"A stamp on your hand, and a nod at the steep end."},{"day":83,"min":881,"text":"Repeat: The Low Roof, V5, on go 3."},{"day":83,"min":889,"text":"Onsight: Heel Hook Grotto, V11, on go 1."},{"day":83,"min":889,"text":"Powerhouse Sender. 40 power lines sent. Big moves are just a Tuesday. Power comes 10% faster."},{"day":83,"min":889,"text":"Gas, $9."},{"day":83,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":83,"min":1090,"text":"Hazel throws the last of the coffee on the fire. It hisses. \"Bedtime,\" it seems to say."},{"day":84,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":84,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":84,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":84,"min":818,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":84,"min":828,"text":"The kid at the desk stamps your hand."},{"day":84,"min":836,"text":"Onsight: The Arête, V0, on go 1."},{"day":84,"min":844,"text":"Onsight: Slopey Topout, V1, on go 1."},{"day":84,"min":852,"text":"Onsight: Pinch Block, V2, on go 1."},{"day":84,"min":860,"text":"Onsight: Toe-Hook Tango, V3, on go 1."},{"day":84,"min":868,"text":"Onsight: Gaston Gauntlet, V4, on go 1."},{"day":84,"min":876,"text":"Board grades: that's no V4. Nobody on the mats is surprised."},{"day":84,"min":876,"text":"Onsight: Left Hand Only, V4, on go 1."},{"day":84,"min":876,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":84,"min":908,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":84,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":84,"min":1090,"text":"Hazel shows you a scar on her knuckle and won’t tell you how. \"Granite,\" is all she says."},{"day":85,"min":440,"text":"Hazel’s driveway. A real bathroom, and coffee in a real mug in the morning."},{"day":85,"min":440,"text":"Registration and insurance: $70. The week's bills don't care about your card."},{"day":85,"min":440,"text":"You take Pure Power, for $24. Send 3 power lines. It counts from now."},{"day":85,"min":460,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":85,"min":460,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":85,"min":828,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":85,"min":828,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":85,"min":848,"text":"A wristband, and a look that says the comp wall is not for warming up on."},{"day":85,"min":856,"text":"Onsight: Bat Hang, V7, on go 1."},{"day":85,"min":864,"text":"Onsight: Swing Start, V8, on go 1."},{"day":85,"min":872,"text":"Onsight: Paddle Dyno, V10, on go 1."},{"day":85,"min":880,"text":"Onsight: Balance Beam, V9, on go 1."},{"day":85,"min":880,"text":"Gas, $2."},{"day":85,"min":922,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":85,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":85,"min":1090,"text":"Hazel says the Lot has one rule nobody wrote down: you don’t ask anyone why they’re here."},{"day":85,"min":1090,"text":"Sage: “Out of town. Send me photos so I can be jealous.”"},{"day":85,"min":1090,"text":"Hazel: \"The Big Stone. I’ll bring the coffee, you bring the psyche.\""},{"day":85,"min":1090,"text":"Rico: \"The Big Stone! Yes. I’ll bring snacks. Mostly for me.\""},{"day":86,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":86,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":86,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":86,"min":466,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":86,"min":536,"text":"Four new tires, balanced. The van drives straight for the first time in months."},{"day":86,"min":536,"text":"Hazel: “Your shift. Now we’re square.”"},{"day":86,"min":536,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":86,"min":903,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":86,"min":903,"text":"A walk-in: paid, and that’s all. Signed-up shifts are the ones that count toward a raise."},{"day":86,"min":903,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":86,"min":923,"text":"A wristband, and a look that says the comp wall is not for warming up on."},{"day":86,"min":931,"text":"Repeat: Bat Hang, V7, on go 2."},{"day":86,"min":939,"text":"Onsight: The Lache, V12, on go 1."},{"day":86,"min":947,"text":"Sliding off, your hand drags over a seam. New beta: crimp the seam."},{"day":86,"min":965,"text":"Redpoint: Glass Feet, V11, on go 2."},{"day":86,"min":965,"text":"Gas, $2."},{"day":86,"min":1007,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":86,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":86,"min":1090,"text":"Hazel says if you want to know a climber, watch them walk down from a route they didn’t send."},{"day":87,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":87,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":87,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":87,"min":818,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":87,"min":818,"text":"Gas, $8."},{"day":87,"min":873,"text":"A stamp on your hand, and a nod at the steep end."},{"day":87,"min":881,"text":"You and Mara are regulars."},{"day":87,"min":881,"text":"Onsight: The Echo, V5, on go 1."},{"day":87,"min":881,"text":"Mara nods once. You’ll remember it for a week."},{"day":87,"min":1061,"text":"You belay Mara all day. She doesn’t send. On the walk out she tells you it was a good day. +2 head."},{"day":87,"min":1069,"text":"Onsight: Undercut Engine, V7, on go 1."},{"day":87,"min":1069,"text":"Pure Power, done. $24 off the board."},{"day":87,"min":1069,"text":"Gas, $9."},{"day":87,"min":1196,"text":"Hazel says the valley gets smaller every year and the climbing gets bigger. Both are true."},{"day":88,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":88,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":88,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":88,"min":818,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":88,"min":818,"text":"Gas, $8."},{"day":88,"min":873,"text":"A stamp on your hand, and a nod at the steep end."},{"day":88,"min":873,"text":"Rico sent it. Half the crag knows your name now, for the wrong reasons."},{"day":88,"min":881,"text":"You and Mara are partners now: you climb, you belay, nobody keeps score."},{"day":88,"min":881,"text":"Onsight: Stalactite, V7, on go 1."},{"day":88,"min":881,"text":"\"About time,\" Mara says, and means it fondly."},{"day":88,"min":889,"text":"Onsight: Bat Out of Hell, V6, on go 1."},{"day":88,"min":897,"text":"Onsight: Dark Edges, V8, on go 1."},{"day":88,"min":905,"text":"Onsight: Leap in the Dark, V9, on go 1."},{"day":88,"min":913,"text":"Your chalk bag is empty."},{"day":88,"min":913,"text":"Onsight: The Round Trip, V10, on go 1."},{"day":88,"min":921,"text":"Onsight: Lip Service, V11, on go 1."},{"day":88,"min":921,"text":"Gas, $9."},{"day":88,"min":998,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":88,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":88,"min":1090,"text":"Hazel asks what you’d climb if your hands didn’t hurt. You both know the answer."},{"day":89,"min":440,"text":"Hazel’s driveway. A real bathroom, and coffee in a real mug in the morning."},{"day":89,"min":460,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":89,"min":460,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":89,"min":474,"text":"You crush half of it into the bag before you reach the door."},{"day":89,"min":838,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":89,"min":848,"text":"The kid at the desk stamps your hand."},{"day":89,"min":848,"text":"You and Sage: together, by any reckoning."},{"day":89,"min":848,"text":"You tell Rico something came up. Rico says it’s fine, in the voice that means it isn’t, and isn’t around for a week. By the weekend Sage and Rico aren’t speaking, and it’s about you, and everyone knows it."},{"day":89,"min":908,"text":"You give Sage the belay, and the catches."},{"day":89,"min":928,"text":"Sage climbs Pocket Rocket. At the dyno: bump. New beta: bump through the pinch."},{"day":89,"min":936,"text":"Onsight: Tension Block, V1, on go 1."},{"day":89,"min":936,"text":"\"Next,\" Sage says, and points at something harder."},{"day":89,"min":944,"text":"Flash: Pocket Rocket, V0, on go 1."},{"day":89,"min":952,"text":"Onsight: Compression, V2, on go 1."},{"day":89,"min":960,"text":"Onsight: Sloper Slap, V3, on go 1."},{"day":89,"min":968,"text":"Onsight: Mantle Madness, V5, on go 1."},{"day":89,"min":976,"text":"Board grades: that's no V5. Nobody on the mats is surprised."},{"day":89,"min":976,"text":"Onsight: Forty Degrees, V5, on go 1."},{"day":89,"min":984,"text":"Onsight: Dyno Lunge, V4, on go 1."},{"day":89,"min":992,"text":"Board grades: that's no V4. Nobody on the mats is surprised."},{"day":89,"min":992,"text":"Onsight: Dead Point, V4, on go 1."},{"day":89,"min":992,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":89,"min":1024,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":89,"min":1094,"text":"Sage says beta is a gift you have to unwrap yourself. Then she gives you the beta anyway."},{"day":90,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":90,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":90,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":90,"min":818,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":90,"min":828,"text":"The kid at the desk stamps your hand."},{"day":90,"min":836,"text":"Board grades: that's no V6. Nobody on the mats is surprised."},{"day":90,"min":836,"text":"Onsight: Squeeze, V6, on go 1."},{"day":90,"min":844,"text":"Board grades: that's no V7. Nobody on the mats is surprised."},{"day":90,"min":844,"text":"Onsight: The Compression Line, V7, on go 1."},{"day":90,"min":844,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":90,"min":876,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":90,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":90,"min":1090,"text":"Hazel talks about rope like other people talk about dogs. She’s had seven. She remembers them all."},{"day":91,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":91,"min":430,"text":"A missed call from home. It’ll keep till you call back."}]}}